WEBVTT

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.856
But she wanted only to make
one small change.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.240
So she called, and she began,

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.920
"Hey, you are a man.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.576
You're not a faggot, you're not a punk,

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.296
and let me tell you the difference.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:18.896
You are prominent. You are intelligent.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:20.896
You dress well. You know how to speak.

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.456
People like you.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:25.416
You don't walk around
doing your hand like a punk.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:27.776
You're not a vagabond on the street.

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:30.296
You are an upstanding person